# Prose, data and the page keep their own layout: Markdown is house-style
# prose, JSON is mostly generated (lockfiles, fixtures, goldens), and the HTML
# shell's whitespace is part of what it renders. Prettier already skips
# node_modules and everything .gitignore lists.
*.md
*.json
*.jsonc
*.html
# BMAD's files: its installer rewrites the skills and the engine on every
# update, and the planning output is prose and copies.
_bmad/
_bmad-output/
.agents/
.claude/
# The help site writes its content types here on every check and build;
# help-site/.gitignore lists them, and Prettier reads only the root .gitignore.
help-site/.astro/
